Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:55:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] Release 0.3.0 packages, evidence and performance log

Replace packages/ with the 0.3.0 source distribution and the wheel built
from it. Record the 0.3.0 release checks: Rust checks and tests, the CLI
request and native sweep, domain validation, installed-wheel checks,
tutorial and user-manual blocks, campaign replay and the SciPy search.
Archive the 0.2.0 top-level evidence under evidence/release-0.2.0/, move
the 0.2.0 patch series to patches/0.2.0/, refresh the example outputs
from the installed wheel and add population-epidemiology-performance-log-0.3.0.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
